  ppd-sigma-pairing: LANDED 2026-07-10 (03a5b85). sampleFromPPD
    now draws gaussian noise in object$sigma's native chain-fastest
    order and reshapes the noise through combineChains when ev is
    combined, so every ppd draw pairs with its own draw's sigma in
    both layouts and same-seed combined/split draws agree
