  prior-predictive: LANDED 2026-07-10 (c37ec3b). Exported
    samplePriorPredictive(sampler, x.test, n.samples, type =
    ev/ppd): fresh private sampler per call (NOT copy() - that
    replays the donor's frozen engine RNG; caught in review),
    prior tree + node-parameter draws evaluated at x.test, ppd
    adds prior-drawn scaled-inv-chisq sigma noise (gaussian) or
    bernoulli draws (binary); independent across calls, set.seed
    reproducible, control rngSeed pins. Rd has the issue-#31
    treatment-effect example.
